Frame structure: iterate through the rolls. For frames 1-9: if the first roll is 10, the frame has 1 roll. Otherwise, the frame has 2 rolls and the sum must not exceed 10. For frame 10: the first roll is 10 → two bonus rolls; first + second == 10 → one bonus roll; otherwise two rolls.

